    "reviews": "\u201cLost Words is a masterpiece. It\u2019s engaging and touching, and relatable for both young kids and adults\u201d<br>9.5/10 \u2013 TechRaptor<br><br>\u201cA beautiful, intelligent game featuring a bright and inquisitive female protagonist\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Gaming Nexus<br><br>\u201cThe climax of Robyn's tale was sublime. Both tender and pragmatic, it was a perfect close\u201d<br>Eurogamer<br>",
